    "body": "Hardware note for the failing box: a hybrid-GPU laptop (Intel Arc 140T integrated + NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 Laptop, Windows 11). The box that passes has a single AMD Radeon 760M. Two adapters racing for a per-test device without a lock is a likely trigger; that box is a good place to prove the fix.",
